[00:00.000] 作词 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:01.000] 作曲 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:02.000] 编曲 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:28.209] I’m sinking in your eyes,
[00:33.682] Too deep to recognise.
[00:39.663] I'm playing by your rules,
[00:45.369] But losing what's inside.
[00:50.151]
[00:56.821] I wasted all my time,
[01:02.322] To chase a fading sign.
[01:07.904] A puppet to your rules,
[01:13.574] Can't break from the line.
[01:17.770]
[01:20.353] Chained inside this grand illusion,
[01:25.655] Wired to dance for your smile.
[01:31.157] You hold my joy, my tears, my pain,
[01:36.621] Yet I still claim that you’re divine.
[01:46.058]
[02:01.459] I never walk in my own shoes,
[02:07.195] just preaching what you choose.
[02:12.866] Craving for a guide
[02:18.422] Holding tight my puppet line
[02:22.722]
[02:47.442] Chained inside this grand illusion,
[02:52.996] Wired to dance for your smile.
[02:58.716] You hold my joy, my tears, my pain,
[03:04.230] Yet I still claim that you’re divine.
[03:16.991]
[03:20.632] sinking in your eyes…
[03:25.675] sinking in your eyes…
[03:30.707] playing by your rules…
[03:35.505] losing what’s inside…
[03:40.636] losing what’s inside…
